    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20521" root="سلك" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَكٌ</span></b>  The <i>young one of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَل</span> [or <i>partridge</i>]; (S, K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَحٌ</span>: (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سلح</span>:) or
<i>of the bird called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطًا</span>: (K:) fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَكَةٌ</span>, (S, K,)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْكَانَةٌ</span></b> , but the latter is rare: (K:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْكَانٌ</span>, (S, K,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرْدَانٌ</span> pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرَدٌ</span> (S) [and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْحَانٌ</span> pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلَحٌ</span>].

